        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "It was a dark and stormy night many years ago."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Lost, I arrived at this house and went inside."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "The lights would not turn on, so I fearfully looked around the house."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Eventually, I made my way into the kitchen. There was no sign of anyone being there..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I found the fridge, and when I opened it, a faint light leaked out."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I could finally make out my surroundings."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "And I saw the faint outline of a man huddling in the corner of the room."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I tried to tell him that I was lost and I was hoping he'd let me stay until morning, but when I approached him..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "The man suddenly screamed, \u201cStay back!\u201d I apologized and continued to plead my case."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "\u201cPlease, can't you help me?\u201d"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "\u201cI'm not talking to you!\u201d he shouted."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I looked at the man in surprise."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "When I did this, the man asked me... \u201cCan't you see them? Behind you!\u201d"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('playsound minecraft:entity.lightning_bolt.impact ambient ' + q.player.username + ' ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "\u201cA horde of faceless men!\u201d"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Now then... Since I told a wonderful story that will always haunt you..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Would you be so kind as to tip me? If you don't, you might see something really scary."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "shauna",
            "lines": [
                "You're charging us?!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
